        // then the balances should remain unchanged.
        // We expect success == false (since the test contract has no receive)
        // In the original, the whole tx reverts. In the mutant, it returns silently.
        // The rule: after a failing Collect call, the refund should not happen.
        // We check: if success is false (the call didn't revert), then balances are unchanged.
        assertTrue(!success || (contractBalanceAfter == contractBalanceBefore && userBalanceAfter == userBalanceBefore));
    }
}

